WEBVTT

00:01:29.517 --> 00:01:31.251
Norman Jewison mi je rekao:

00:01:31.275 --> 00:01:34.267
"Mislim da sve to ima veze sa
fokusiranjem na jednu stvar".

00:01:34.773 --> 00:01:35.838
I trudi se!

00:01:36.235 --> 00:01:38.223
David Gallo kaže: "Trudi se.

00:01:38.247 --> 00:01:40.889
Fizički, mentalno,
moraš se truditi, truditi, truditi."

00:01:40.913 --> 00:01:43.524
Moraš savladati stidljivost i nesigurnost.

00:01:43.548 --> 00:01:45.976
Goldie Hawn kaže,
"Uvijek sam bila nesigurna u sebe.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.206
Nisam bila dovoljno dobra,
dovoljno pametna.

00:01:48.206 --> 00:01:49.663
Nisam mislila da ću uspjeti."

00:01:50.264 --> 00:01:52.303
Nije uvijek lako da sam sebe tjeraš,

00:01:52.327 --> 00:01:54.415
i zato su izumili majke.

00:01:54.439 --> 00:01:55.439
(Smijeh)

00:01:55.439 --> 00:01:57.000
(Aplauz)

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.976
Frank Gehry mi je rekao:

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.370
"Moja majka me je tjerala".